n adventure and share it with your friends. </li></ul> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742380/extras/5f881c7a4da49fb3d7b5a186c1c226c8.poster.avif?t=1726297788\" width=540 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742380/extras/5f881c7a4da49fb3d7b5a186c1c226c8.webm?t=1726297788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742380/extras/5f881c7a4da49fb3d7b5a186c1c226c8.mp4?t=1726297788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Notice</strong>: a controller is strongly recommended to play this game.<br><br>Want to check out the next game from unbeGames?",
